A '''Chilling Area''' is a [[ground effect]] that causes enemies inside it to be {{stl|Chill}}ed. Chilled Ground, Creeping Frost, Frost Shield, and Vortices are Chilling Areas.

==Sources==
* {{il|Creeping Frost}}
* {{il|Frost Shield}}
* {{il|Vaal Cold Snap}}
* [[Chilled Ground]], including but not limited to the following sources:
** {{il|Vortex}}
** {{il|Cold Snap}}
** {{il|Frostblink}}
** {{il|Arctic Armour}}
** {{il|Frost Blades of Katabasis}} 

Chilling areas always create a visible effect. Note that other effects that chill enemies in an area like {{il|Summon Skitterbots}}, {{il|Expedition's End}}, [[Corpse Pact]], and [[Chilling Presence]] are not considered chilling areas.<ref>https://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/3284453</ref>

==Mechanics==

Enemies that are inside a chilling area are chilled. All chilling areas are affected by modifiers to the effect of cold and/or non-damaging ailments, including from the player's stats and [[support gem]]s. Other chill-related stats, such as {{c|mod|15% increased Elemental Damage if you've Chilled an Enemy Recently}} from {{psl|Sadist}}, apply inconsistently depending on the source of the chilling area:

* Chilled Ground and the chilling effects from {{il|Vortex}}, {{il|Frost Blades of Katabasis}}, and {{il|Vaal Cold Snap}} never count as chills inflicted by the player. They ''cannot'' apply ''chilled by you'' stats, cannot make the player count as having chilled recently, and can chill regardless of stats that prevent the application of chill by the skill or player, such as {{il|Elemental Focus}} or {{psl|Secrets of Suffering}}. 
* {{il|Creeping Frost}}'s ground effect and {{il|Frost Shield}} do count as chills from the player. They apply ''chilled by you'' stats, do make the player count as having chilled recently, and cannot chill when the player or skill cannot chill. 

Chilling areas from your skills used by [[proxies]] (e.g. [[totem]]s) follow the behaviour described above, though they cannot make the player count as having chilled recently. Chilling areas created by your [[minion]]s are never considered "your chilling areas".

Effects that apply to {{c|mod|Enemies in your Chilling Areas}} like {{il|Algor Mortis}} are applied even if the target cannot be chilled, or if the area is affected by the player's {{c|mod|Cannot Chill}}.

==Skill gems==
{{Drop enabled gem table
|where = items.class_id="Active Skill Gem"
  AND (skill.description LIKE "%Chilling Area%" OR skill.description LIKE "%Chilled Ground%" OR skill.description LIKE "%Whirling Vortex%" OR skill.description LIKE "%Area are Chilled%")
}}

==Support gems==
{{Drop enabled gem table
|where = items.class_id="Support Skill Gem"
  AND (skill.description LIKE "%Chilling Area%")
}}

==Unique items==
{{Drop enabled unique item table
|tables=item_stats
|join=items._pageID=item_stats._pageID
|where=
  item_stats.id LIKE "%Chilling%Area%"
|level=1
|large=1
|stat=1
}}

==Related modifiers==
===Item mods===
{{Query spawnable modifiers
|where=mods.domain=1 AND (mod_stats.id LIKE "%Chilling%Area%" OR mods.stat_text LIKE "%Chilling%Area%")
|spawn_weights=1
}}

